# agentic-trader — droplet crontab template.
#
# ⚠️ FIRST INSTALL ONLY:  crontab deploy/crontab.template
# On the ALREADY-DEPLOYED box, do NOT run that — the live crontab carries box-only
# jobs this file does not (moomoo-vol-desk 9:30/9:35, moomoo-data-collector 16:30)
# and a wholesale install WIPES them. Arm a new job by APPENDING the single line,
# then `diff` the before/after. See docs/DEPLOY.md Phase 4.
#
# ⚠️ EDITING THIS FILE ARMS NOTHING. It documents intent; `crontab -l` is the
# source of truth. "Schedule X" is not done until the line shows in `crontab -l`.
# (Missed twice: 2026-07-20 universe refresh, 2026-07-24 signal panel.)
#
# Times are in the droplet's local TZ — set the box to US/Eastern or convert.
# ⚠️ Do NOT put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY here or anywhere — it forces per-token billing.

# Cron runs with a bare PATH; give it node/npm (claude), python, git, coreutils.
# `which claude` on the box will confirm the right dir if claude isn't found.
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
# Auth: Claude uses the interactive login stored in /root/.claude.json (from
# `claude` + `/mcp`). No CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN needed — do NOT set a bogus one.
HOME=/root

# --- SLOW LOOP (pure Python, no Claude) ---
# Weekly full rebalance: Sunday 20:00 — fetch fresh prices, re-rank, write the book.
0 20 * * 0   /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_slow_loop.sh >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/slow.log 2>&1

# --- WEEKLY moomoo SIGNAL PANEL (system python3 — moomoo needs 3.10, not .venv) ---
# Sun 20:15, after the 20:00 rebalance writes the new book. Forward-logs a
# signal_panel journal event per held name for later meta-labeling. Non-fatal.
# `timeout 900` is the OUTER guard. The script bounds itself with SIGALRM
# (COLLECT_TIMEOUT), which is what produces the phone alert; this is the
# belt-and-braces for the case where a C-level call masks the signal. A healthy
# run takes ~2s, so neither bound is anywhere near the happy path.
15 20 * * 0  cd /opt/agentic-trader && timeout 900 /usr/bin/python3 scripts/collect_signals.py >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/signals.log 2>&1

# Nightly risk-exit recompute: Mon–Fri 18:00 (after close).
0 18 * * 1-5 /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_slow_loop.sh >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/slow.log 2>&1

# --- FAST LOOP (headless Claude, places the approved plan) ---
# Mon–Fri 10:00 (after the open). No-op unless [proof] live_approved=true.
0 10 * * 1-5 /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_fast_loop.sh >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/fast.log 2>&1

# --- DAILY EQUITY LOG (post-close, feeds mandate.drawdown()'s close-to-close series) ---
# Mon–Fri 16:15 ET — deliberately its OWN entry, not folded into the fast loop
# (10:00 ET, 32min after the open — the noisiest stretch of the session; the
# mandate promises close-to-close, never intraday) or the slow loop (would
# couple the equity track record to the book rebuild succeeding, and the
# Sunday 20:00 rebalance would write a spurious weekend point duplicating
# Friday's marks). 16:15 matches this codebase's settled-session boundary —
# see _drop_unsettled_session() in scripts/fetch_prices.py. See scripts/log_equity.py.
15 16 * * 1-5 cd /opt/agentic-trader && .venv/bin/python scripts/log_equity.py >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/equity.log 2>&1

# --- INTRADAY RISK REVIEW (headless Claude, stricter-only de-risk overlay) ---
# Times are ET per this file's header convention (box is set to US/Eastern) —
# no CRON_TZ needed, direct local-time entries like the other jobs.
# 12:00 ET midday check + 15:45 ET pre-close tend, Mon–Fri.
0 12 * * 1-5  /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_risk_review.sh >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/risk_review.log 2>&1
45 15 * * 1-5 /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_risk_review.sh >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/risk_review.log 2>&1

# --- AGENT SESSIONS (the inversion) - the agent decides, LIVE 2026-08-12 ---
# Supervision (lock, brief, process group, integrity tripwire, verdict) lives in
# scripts/session.py. Orders pass the PreToolUse gate declared in
# deploy/loop_settings.json: kill switch, order cap, universe whitelist,
# live_approved. Kill switch = touch research_store/HALT.
#
# deploy/run_session.sh MUST be executable (100755). A 100644 deploy makes cron
# fail at exit 126 BEFORE alert.sh installs the ERR trap - no phone push, no
# health check, the slot silently does nothing.
#
# Times are constrained by MEASUREMENT, not preference:
#  10:35 - run_fast_loop.sh starts 10:00 and finishes ~10:04 (logs/fast.log).
#          Running inside that window puts two Claude processes in
#          research_store at once.
#  15:15 - must land BEFORE risk_review at 15:45. Both read-modify-write
#          monitor/overrides.json with no shared lock, and the interleaving was
#          measured DROPPING a risk_review protective stop. close times out at
#          1200s, so this ends by 15:35 with ten minutes of margin.
#          Do NOT "tidy" these onto the same minute.
35 10 * * 1-5 /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_session.sh open >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/session.log 2>&1
15 15 * * 1-5 /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_session.sh close >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/session.log 2>&1


# --- WEEKLY INVESTOR LETTER (headless Claude narrative, then email) ---
# Sunday 21:00, after the slow loop writes the new book — the letter wraps the
# week and previews Monday's rotation. Emails only once NEWSLETTER_* creds
# exist in .env; until then it just writes research_store/newsletters/.
0 21 * * 0   /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_newsletter.sh >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/newsletter.log 2>&1

# --- NIGHTLY LEDGER BACKUP (catch-all in case a run's inline backup missed) ---
30 22 * * *  cd /opt/agentic-trader && deploy/backup_ledger.sh >> logs/backup.log 2>&1

# --- DAILY UPKEEP CHECK (the reminder channel) ---
# 08:00 daily. Pure-Python, no Claude, places nothing. Checks that every scheduled
# job left a fresh artifact and that the Schwab token isn't about to expire, then
# pushes to the OPS ntfy topic (job names + ages only — never positions or P&L).
# Fire-once per condition; the dashboard carries standing status.
# REPLACED deploy/reauth_reminder.sh, which nagged every Monday whether or not you
# had already re-authed and never escalated if you missed it. This one reads the
# real token age, so it is silent when you're current and speaks up when you're not.
# --open-issue: also files/comments a deduped `bug`+`auto-fix` GitHub issue
# ("🔴 Scheduled job unhealthy") for the same fire-once conditions, feeding the
# claude.yml oversight loop. Never breaks the push if `gh` fails — see
# scripts/health_check.py.
0 8 * * *    cd /opt/agentic-trader && .venv/bin/python scripts/health_check.py --open-issue >> logs/health.log 2>&1

# --- QUARTERLY UNIVERSE REFRESH (Piece 1) — first Sunday of Jan/Apr/Jul/Oct, 19:00 ET ---
# DOW left as * to avoid cron's day-of-month OR day-of-week gotcha; the wrapper's
# `date +%u`==7 guard enforces "first Sunday" (cron restricts to days 1-7).
0 19 1-7 1,4,7,10 *  /opt/agentic-trader/deploy/run_universe_refresh.sh >> /opt/agentic-trader/logs/universe.log 2>&1
